": "A vehicle carrying Ukrainian soldiers is moving at high speed through an anti-drone tunnel somewhere in Donbas, trying to avoid a strike from a Russian FPV drone. At the turn, the driver pulls off an absolutely insane sideways drift \u2014 passing the Ukrainian UGV by literally a few millimeters", "link": "https://t.me/combat_ftg2/3674", "pubDate": "2026-09-07T10:27:07+00:00"}, {"channel": "combat_ftg2", "snippet": "Ukrainian soldiers assaulted a Russian position in the Sumy direction and captured a Russian soldier. The unit then was attacked by enemy FPV drones, two soldiers were wounded", "snippet_en": "Ukrainian soldiers assaulted a Russian position in the Sumy direction and captured a Russian soldier. The unit then was attacked by enemy FPV drones, two soldiers were wounded", "link": "https://t.me/combat_ftg2/3669", "pubDate": "2026-08-30T18:12:18+00:00"}, {"channel": "combat_ftg2", "snippet": "Ukrainian dildo of consequence intercepting russian FPV", "snippet_en": "Ukrainian dildo of consequence intercepting russian FPV", "link": "https://t.me/combat_ftg2/3667", "pubDate": "2026-08-27T09:07:16+00:00"}, {"channel": "wartranslated", "snippet": "Zelensky says Russia fired over 2,000 attack drones, mostly jet-powered, 1,700 guided bombs and 19 missiles at Ukraine this week alone. Strikes hit Kherson, Kharkiv, Sumy, Odesa, Dnipro, Zaporizhzhia, Vinnytsia, Kyiv, Zhytomyr and Cherkasy regions. A Russian FPV drone struck a monastery in Kherson region, killing one monk and wounding four.", "snippet_en": "Zelensky says Russia fired over 2,000 attack drones, mostly jet-powered, 1,700 guided bombs and 19 missiles at Ukraine this week alone. Strikes hit Kherson, Kharkiv, Sumy, Odesa, Dnipro, Zaporizhzhia, Vinnytsia, Kyiv, Zhytomyr and Cherkasy regions. A Russian FPV drone struck a monastery in Kherson region, killing one monk and wounding four.", "link": "https://t.me/s/wartranslated", "pubDate": ""}], "updated": "20 Sep 2026, 13:19 UTC", "count": 16}